[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3946261555","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116676#issuecomment-3946261555","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116676","id":3946261555,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rNywz","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-23T17:36:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T17:36:37Z","body":"I can confirm that this fixes the MRP in #116674, as well as the real-world project where we ran into this, but since you're just doing a `return;` from the entire function you'll also skip any later part of `_blend_post_process`, such as these:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a3e84cc2af14aa4cffbefd8e13492e59567a64e3/scene/animation/animation_player.cpp#L366-L369\r\n\r\nIs that the intention?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3946261555/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3946454006","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116676#issuecomment-3946454006","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116676","id":3946454006,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rOhv2","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-23T18:12:18Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T18:12:18Z","body":"@mihe I made the process the same as #110508 after the abort, but now that you mention it, it certainly makes more sense to have those cleanups. Fixed.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3946454006/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3947597305","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116676#issuecomment-3947597305","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116676","id":3947597305,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rS435","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-23T22:08:24Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T22:08:24Z","body":"If you do this instead you won't need to duplicate the cleanup code:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\nvoid AnimationPlayer::_blend_post_process() {\r\n\tif (end_reached) {\r\n\t\t// If the method track changes current animation, the animation is not finished.\r\n\t\tif (tmp_from == animation_set[playback.current.animation_name].animation->get_instance_id()) {\r\n\t\t\tif (playback_queue.size()) {\r\n\t\t\t\tif (!finished_anim.is_empty()) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\temit_signal(SceneStringName(animation_finished), finished_anim);\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n+\t\t\t\tif (playback_queue.size()) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\tString old = playback.assigned;\r\n\t\t\t\t\tplay(playback_queue.front()->get());\r\n\t\t\t\t\tString new_name = playback.assigned;\r\n\t\t\t\t\tplayback_queue.pop_front();\r\n\t\t\t\t\tif (end_notify) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\temit_signal(SceneStringName(animation_changed), old, new_name);\r\n\t\t\t\t\t}\r\n+\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t} else {\r\n\t\t\t\t_clear_caches();\r\n\t\t\t\tplaying = false;\r\n\t\t\t\t_set_process(false);\r\n\t\t\t\tif (end_notify) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\tif (!finished_anim.is_empty()) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\temit_signal(SceneStringName(animation_finished), finished_anim);\r\n\t\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\t\temit_signal(SNAME(\"current_animation_changed\"), \"\");\r\n\t\t\t\t\tif (movie_quit_on_finish && OS::get_singleton()->has_feature(\"movie\")) {\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tprint_line(vformat(\"Movie Maker mode is enabled. Quitting on animation finish as requested by: %s\", get_path()));\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tget_tree()->quit();\r\n\t\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\tend_reached = false;\r\n\t\tend_notify = false;\r\n\t}\r\n\ttmp_from = ObjectID();\r\n}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3947597305/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3949246531","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116676#issuecomment-3949246531","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116676","id":3949246531,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rZLhD","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-24T05:42:14Z","updated_at":"2026-02-24T05:58:07Z","body":"@mihe I have considered that code, and while it looks cleaner, but the current code is the result because your code would always checke `playback_queue.size()` twice in the general case where `finished_anim.is_empty` is false from the start and the queue is not removed within `animation_finished`.\r\n\r\nAlso, if we were to separate the functions related to the queue, we could simply use `return;`. However, considering the cost of function calls and the not good visibility due to the `animation_finished` signal being triggered in two functions, I believe the current code structure is preferable.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3949246531/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3952974109","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116676#issuecomment-3952974109","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116676","id":3952974109,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7rnZkd","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_u